    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweepin' XS is a reimagination of classic minesweeper which brings new tiles and abilities to the mix. Shop for useful tiles, beat 12 boards in a row and win the run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, there are: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 new tiles which give you safe clicks, uncover their surroundings, multiply your score, and other weird effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Faces, which are abilities that you can use every board, a limited amount of times per board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Flags that change the way you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops between boards to buy useful tiles or more uses for your abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses that spice up the gameplay every 3 boards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 difficulties that get more challenging each time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweepin' XS is a reimagination of classic minesweeper which brings new tiles and abilities to the mix. Shop for useful tiles, beat 12 boards in a row and win the run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, there are: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 new tiles which give you safe clicks, uncover their surroundings, multiply your score, and other weird effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Faces, which are abilities that you can use every board, a limited amount of times per board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Flags that change the way you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops between boards to buy useful tiles or more uses for your abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses that spice up the gameplay every 3 boards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 difficulties that get more challenging each time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements!</p></li></ul>",
